{"about_the_game":"<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Short exploration adventure with casual point-and-click puzzles.<br></li><li><strong>No text.</strong><br></li><li>All the graphics and animations are handmade from plasticine.<br></li><li>Beautiful soundtrack.</li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1153130/extras/bd034f1a3b932236863877304bde8402.poster.avif?t=1740984410\" width=600 height=206 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1153130/extras/bd034f1a3b932236863877304bde8402.webm?t=1740984410\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1153130/extras/bd034f1a3b932236863877304bde8402.mp4?t=1740984410\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Wurroom is an interactive art experience born in the minds of two holographic entities: Michael Rfdshir and Serge Bulat.<br>You are just a cursor-Hand, lost in the undefined hyper wonderland, where visions, thoughts, and ideas from your subconscious, intermix with the fragments of &quot;other&quot;, inexperienced worlds. <br><br>Wait... am I.. just a hand...??? Or am I the leading force behind all this, the one that could shake the core of this strange place?!<br><br>Wurroom is an immersive experience into a surreal utopia, disguised as a short exploration adventure game. The hero is a mouse cursor; an ordinary Hand, becoming aware of its power over the strange Imaginarium. <br><br>Wurroom is not just a game, it's an artistic collision between the minds of Michael Rifdshir and Serge Bulat; a metaphysical island created for the coexistence of ideas about art, nature, science, and Mind; all to question reality, and make a boundaryless new one. It is designed to reveal things about ourselves and measure our imagination.  <br><br>Everything you see in Wurroom is handmade; the claymated universe brought to live by stop-frame animation. <br>The music is the gluing force and the true master of this extraordinary world. Once you close your eyes, the world becomes you. <br><br>But beware of the truth... you don't play the game. The game plays you to learn about its very existence.","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"fdaa26d46b2c04b0697987bbfbfa046bdaecafff.jpg","localized_name":"Welcome, Traveler","name":"Welcome, Traveler","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1153130/fdaa26d46b2c04b0697987bbfbfa046bdaecafff.jpg"},{"icon":"22e677d1c1771d2b1ace1d4d881b3d952448e1fc.jpg","localized_name":"Liquid walls","name":"Liquid walls","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1153130/22e677d1c1771d2b1ace1d4d881b3d952448e1fc.jpg"},{"icon":"495ee3ee41e951684b30d72b2fbbba471c863ed4.jpg","localized_name":"Grand Cube Master","name":"Grand Cube Master","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1153130/495ee3ee41e951684b30d72b2fbbba471c863ed4.jpg"},{"icon":"6e9917db63b716397509b0916860f577086f6672.jpg","localized_name":"These shoes are so tight","name":"These shoes are so tight","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1153130/6e9917db63b716397509b0916860f577086f6672.jpg"},{"icon":"fd5e3df622637e80d44b6c6acf55cc28d5b6fb3e.jpg","localized_name":"Everything has a beginning","name":"Everything has a beginning","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1153130/fd5e3df622637e80d44b6c6acf55cc28d5b6fb3e.jpg"},{"icon":"9cc814bf04617260721f95082488aee510003a0c.jpg","localized_name":"The opened sea","name":"The opened sea","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1153130/9cc814bf04617260721f95082488aee510003a0c.jpg"},{"icon":"98b20d33c14c01e1f1080b244fa61d966dd81ee6.jpg","localized_name":"The whole picture","name":"The whole picture","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/ste